{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43080","headline":"古别离 · 常理","name":"古别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君御狐白裘，妾居缃绮帱。\n粟钿金夹膝，花错玉搔头。\n离别生庭草，征衣断戍楼。\n蠨蛸网清曙，菡萏落红秋。\n小胆空房怯，长眉满镜愁。\n爲传儿女意，不用远封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常理","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}